        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island sure is taking their time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're almost at the interception point!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch, finally... I just finished unpacking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a waste.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up! Those in the back, follow more closely!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, masked person over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is it? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of you, come at me. I'm short on time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_indoor_2",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, Texas from Penguin Logistics has returned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh... what a relief!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I have an update here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just took care of some guys who called themselves 'Reunion.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "... But there are a lot more of them coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion has come out of hiding and are starting to move in groups.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's as I feared...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion has already infiltrated Lungmen through the slums...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And their target... is the same as ours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, there would be no reason for them to come after Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Misha is carrying secrets that only Lungmen and Reunion know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're caught in a disadvantageous situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Things aren't looking good for us right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll really have to poke that officer's pretty little face later to find out what's actually going on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Anything else to add?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "If not, I'll lead the way. I know exactly where to go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exusiai has confirmed our escape route. I'll now take you through it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Franka, gather all the squads. We--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We... should find cover first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion is already here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Over here! Don't let them get away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nothing more annoying than when trouble keeps nipping at your tail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Something's wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "No...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "They... have a leader!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
